{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16110","headline":"贺杨巨源博士拜虞部员外 · 王建","name":"贺杨巨源博士拜虞部员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"合归兰署已多时，上得金梯亦未迟。\n两省郎官开道路，九州山泽属曹司。\n诸生拜别收书卷，旧客看来读制词。\n残着几丸仙药在，分张还遣病夫知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16110.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16110","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}